THE BLANK SLATE PROTOCOL
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The KOS does not impose a philosophy. It provides the
architecture for a human to build their own. Every deployment
begins cold. The system has no opinions about what your
CORE_THESIS should say, what your relational targets should
be, or what you should optimize for. It is a mirror, not an
echo. The operator's sovereignty over their own cognitive
architecture is the point.

We automate the machine so we can be free to be human.
